# pylon-player
===
 A calmer, redesigned media player built on the VLC engine, for Windows, Linux and macOS. Hover-only controls, seek bar previews, a music library, a drag-to-sync subtitle timeline, per-show presets, themes and auto-updates. Based on Juxtopposed's VLC redesign.
